## Third-Party Software Notices and Licensing Attributions

This repository and distribution bundles incorporate, link with, or dynamically load
the following open-source software libraries under their respective licenses:

### 1. FFmpeg & FFmpeg.wasm
- **Project:** FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) & FFmpeg.wasm (https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm)
- **License:** GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 (LGPL v2.1) or GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL v3) depending on build flags.
- **Attribution & Compliance:**
  VEdit interacts with FFmpeg compiled to WebAssembly via the `@ffmpeg/ffmpeg` wrapper packages.
  The underlying FFmpeg WebAssembly binaries (`ffmpeg-core.js`, `ffmpeg-core.wasm`) are loaded dynamically
  at runtime as separate modules. In accordance with LGPL v2.1 / GPL v3 terms, the source code of FFmpeg
  and the WebAssembly build scripts remain publicly available at https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm
  and https://ffmpeg.org. No proprietary modifications are made to the core FFmpeg binaries.

### 2. ONNX Runtime Web
- **Project:** ONNX Runtime (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime)
- **License:** MIT License
- **Copyright:** Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.

### 3. Transformers.js
- **Project:** Transformers.js (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js)
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Copyright:** Copyright (c) Hugging Face Inc. All rights reserved.

### 4. React & React DOM
- **Project:** React (https://github.com/facebook/react)
- **License:** MIT License
- **Copyright:** Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

### 5. Zustand & Zundo
- **Project:** Zustand (https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand) & Zundo (https://github.com/charkour/zundo)
- **License:** MIT License
- **Copyright:** Copyright (c) Paul Henschel and contributors.

### 6. Media Utilities (mp4box.js, mp4-muxer, mediabunny)
- **mp4box.js:** BSD-3-Clause License, Copyright (c) Telecom ParisTech.
- **mp4-muxer:** MIT License, Copyright (c) Vanilagy.
- **mediabunny:** MIT License, Copyright (c) mediabunny contributors.

### 7. Lucide Icons
- **Project:** Lucide (https://lucide.dev)
- **License:** ISC License
- **Copyright:** Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors.

